  << /ActualText (With over a decade of experience across fintech\054 e\055commerce\054 and consumer apps\054 I\047ve developed a passion for simplifying complexity\056 My work is rooted in metric driven decisions that not only solve user goals\054 but address business objectives and drive growth\056)
